sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant UI as BIA Interface
    participant API as API Gateway
    participant BIA as BIA Service
    participant AI as AI Foundation
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Event as EventBus
    
    User->>UI: Start BIA Wizard
    UI->>API: GET /bia/wizard/start
    API->>BIA: Initialize BIA Session
    BIA->>DB: Create BIA Record
    BIA->>Event: Publish(BIA.Started)
    BIA-->>UI: Session ID + Step 1
    
    User->>UI: Enter Critical Functions
    UI->>API: POST /bia/functions
    API->>BIA: Save Functions
    BIA->>AI: Analyze Functions
    AI-->>BIA: AI Recommendations
    BIA->>Event: Publish(BIA.FunctionsAnalyzed)
    BIA-->>UI: Step 2 + AI Insights
    
    User->>UI: Define Dependencies
    UI->>API: POST /bia/dependencies
    API->>BIA: Save Dependencies
    BIA->>AI: Dependency Graph Analysis
    AI-->>BIA: Dependency Map
    BIA->>Event: Publish(BIA.DependenciesAnalyzed)
    BIA-->>UI: Step 3 + Visualization
    
    User->>UI: Set RTOs/RPOs
    UI->>API: POST /bia/objectives
    API->>BIA: Save Objectives
    BIA->>AI: Validate Objectives
    AI-->>BIA: Validation + Suggestions
    BIA->>DB: Update BIA Record
    BIA->>Event: Publish(BIA.Completed)
    BIA-->>UI: BIA Report + Next Steps
    
    Note over Event: Triggers downstream services
    Event->>Risk Service: Auto-create risk scenarios
    Event->>Planning Service: Suggest BC plans